ransparency Settings**: Adjust limb visibility (0-100%)\n- **Quick Toggle**: Custom keybind for instant enable/disable\n\n### 👁️ Advanced ESP System\n- **Box ESP**: 2D/3D boxes around players\n- **Health Bars**: Visual health indicators with color gradients\n- **Name Tags**: Player identification with distance\n- **Tracers**: Line indicators to targets\n- **Team Colors**: Green for allies, Red for enemies\n- **Chams**: Wallhack visibility through objects\n- **Off-Screen Arrows**: Direction indicators for off-screen players\n- **Weapon Display**: Show equipped weapons\n\n### 🎨 Customization\n- **Multiple Themes**: 9 beautiful UI themes\n- **Real-time Adjustments**: All settings update instantly\n- **Configuration Saving**: Automatically saves your preferences\n\n### 👥 Community Integration\n- **Discord Server**: Built-in join button in the Community tab\n- **Quick Access**: One-click copy Discord invite link\n- **Support & Updates**: Get help and stay updated with new features\n\n## 🚀 How to Use\n\n1. **Execute** the script in your executor\n2. **Navigate** through the intuitive UI tabs\n3. **Join Discord** via the Community tab for support\n4. **Adjust** settings to your preference\n5. **Dominate** with enhanced combat capabilities\n\n## ⚙️ Requirements\n\n- Roblox Executor (Synapse, ScriptWare, Krnl, etc.)\n- Game with hitbox-based combat\n\n## 🔒 Safety Features\n\n- **Team Protection**: Won't target friendly players\n- **Anti-Cheat Considerations**: Optimized for detection avoidance\n- **Performance Optimized**: Minimal impact on game performance\n\n## 📁 Configuration\n\n- Auto-saves settings to `YannCGConfigs` folder\n- Easy theme switching\n- Persistent keybinds\n\n## 🤝 Join Our Community\n\n**We highly recommend joining our Discord server!**\n\n- 🆘 **Get Support**: Quick help with any issues\n- 🔄 **Stay Updated**: Be the first to get new features\n- 💡 **Share Ideas**: Suggest new features and improvements\n- 🎮 **Find Teammates**: Connect with other users\n\n*Cl